# =============================================================================
# PAYMASTER WALLET CONFIGURATION (Multi-Wallet Support)
# =============================================================================

# Option 1: Single Wallet Mode (Default - Sequential Processing)
# Use FACILITATOR_PRIVATE_KEY for backward compatibility
# All settlements will be queued and processed one at a time
FACILITATOR_PRIVATE_KEY=0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef

# Option 2: Multi-Wallet Mode (Recommended for Production - Parallel Processing)
# Uncomment and configure PAYMASTER_PRIVATE_KEYS to enable parallel settlements
# Add multiple private keys separated by commas (no spaces)
# Each wallet can process one settlement simultaneously
# 
# Example with 5 wallets (can handle 5 concurrent settlements):
# PAYMASTER_PRIVATE_KEYS=0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111,0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222,0x3333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333333,0x4444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444444,0x5555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555555

# Performance Guide:
# 1 wallet  = Sequential processing (~5 min for 20 settlements)
# 5 wallets = 5x parallel processing (~1 min for 20 settlements)
# 10 wallets = 10x parallel processing (~30 sec for 20 settlements)
# 20 wallets = 20x parallel processing (~15 sec for 20 settlements)

# Important Notes:
# - Each wallet must be funded with native gas tokens (ETH, etc)
# - Wallets are selected using 
# - When PAYMASTER_PRIVATE_KEYS is set, it overrides FACILITATOR_PRIVATE_KEY
# - No database configuration needed - all wallets loaded from environment
# - Can add/remove wallets dynamically by updating this file and restarting

# Security Best Practices:
# - Never commit .env file to git
# - Use different wallets per environment (dev/staging/prod)
# - Monitor wallet balances regularly
# - Set up low-balance alerts
# - Keep at least 0.05-0.1 ETH per wallet for gas

# =============================================================================
round-robin strategy